    {
      "id": "17e0eb2230",
      "kind": "head",
      "key": "title",
      "text": "Google Meet attendance template (that fills itself in) — 2026 — Attendance Tracker"
    },
    {
      "id": "dad073efe6",
      "kind": "head",
      "key": "meta[name=\"description\"]",
      "text": "Looking for a Google Meet attendance template? Here is the exact column layout a good attendance sheet needs — and a free add-on that generates that sheet automatically for every meeting."
    },
    {
      "id": "851488a33f",
      "kind": "head",
      "key": "meta[property=\"og:title\"]",
      "text": "Google Meet attendance template (that fills itself in)"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c075f4b69",
      "kind": "head",
      "key": "meta[property=\"og:description\"]",
      "text": "The exact columns an online class attendance sheet needs — Name, Email, Status, Attendance %, Duration, Join/Leave times — generated automatically per meeting."
    },
    {
      "id": "d9334f5067",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "div",
      "text": "<img src=\"icons/icon-96.png\" alt=\"\">\n      <a href=\"/\">Attendance Tracker</a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "86cf868ebc",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h1",
      "text": "Google Meet attendance template (that fills itself in) — 2026"
    },
    {
      "id": "18aebb938b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "If you searched for an attendance sheet template for your online classes, you have probably already lost a few evenings to copy-pasting names, fixing broken formulas, and filling the same grid in by hand after every session. This page gives you the exact column layout a good Google Meet attendance sheet needs — and then shows you the shortcut: a free add-on that generates that exact sheet automatically, for every meeting, with the data already filled in."
    },
    {
      "id": "6db531907c",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "div",
      "text": "<strong>The best template is one you never have to fill in:</strong> Attendance Tracker is an official Google Meet add-on that watches who joins, when, and for how long — then hands you a finished CSV, PDF, or Google Sheet with all nine columns below completed. No formulas, no retyping, no forgetting to mark someone late."
    },
    {
      "id": "04f0e790c2",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "The columns every online class attendance template needs"
    },
    {
      "id": "e48b8c49d6",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Whether you build the sheet yourself or let software do it, a defensible attendance record needs more than a name and a checkbox. Here is the layout that holds up when a student, parent, or administrator asks questions later:"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c58af3193",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "th",
      "text": "Column"
    },
    {
      "id": "51526ae4fd",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "th",
      "text": "Why it matters"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d14811c07",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Name</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "efa7578cf4",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "The student's display name, matched against your roster."
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b2bbb147",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Email</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "029a4996ec",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "The stable identifier — names change, get abbreviated, or repeat; emails don't."
    },
    {
      "id": "5dc06bae12",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Status</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "63a1fa522b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Present / Late / Left Early / Absent / Excused / Guest — a plain checkmark can't capture the difference between \"showed up on time\" and \"arrived 20 minutes in.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "8ebb7aaac0",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Attendance %</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "738ccc57b2",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Minutes attended ÷ class length. The fairest single number for participation grades."
    },
    {
      "id": "770caefd29",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Duration (min)</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "3fb76e6cc3",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Total active minutes, so a 5-minute drop-in doesn't count like a full session."
    },
    {
      "id": "6c16068b7f",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Join Time</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c9044a562",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Proof of when they actually arrived — the basis for late flags."
    },
    {
      "id": "202ed1f683",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Leave Time</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e9ff7fe0e",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Catches early leavers, not just late arrivers."
    },
    {
      "id": "0005991f39",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Rejoins</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2305fd6b8",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Distinguishes an unstable connection (many rejoins, honest attendance) from someone who left and came back at the end."
    },
    {
      "id": "1d80afb41f",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "<strong>Notes</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "baa6b51705",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "td",
      "text": "Room for context: excused reasons, tech issues, make-up work."
    },
    {
      "id": "4692cc3436",
      "kind": "textnode",
      "key": "div",
      "text": "Ready-to-Use Google Sheets Template · Free"
    },
    {
      "id": "547d60788c",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h3",
      "text": "Google Meet Attendance Spreadsheet Template (With Built-in Formulas)"
